The University of Edinburgh is a world-class organisation. We look for the best in the field across all disciplines and provide a working environment where academics can develop their careers and passion for their chosen subject area. We offer the full range of academic roles and have a genuine focus on our students performance and wellbeing.

We are looking for a motivated researcher with experience using mixed methods, including designing online surveys, conducting semi-structured interviews, and organising workshop discussions. Successful candidates will provide a clear outline of their rationale for applying for the role, a concise overview of relevant experience designing research projects, and writing up projects in academic reports and peer reviewed journals. Demonstrated ability to work independently and with researchers from a range of disciplinary backgrounds is also desirable.&nbsp;

